DEVIATIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hanzo Engine has diverged substantially from upstream mistral.rs:

  - Full Hanzo rebrand: every workspace crate is renamed hanzo-* (hanzo-engine,
    hanzo-server-core, hanzo-router, hanzo-quant, hanzo-vision, hanzo-audio,
    hanzo-paged-attn, hanzo-llm-mcp, hanzo-sandbox, hanzo-code-exec, hanzo-cli,
    hanzo-pyo3, hanzo-film), and the CLI/binary is `hanzo`.
  - Candle is consumed as Hanzo's fork (hanzo-ml, hanzo-nn, hanzo-flash-attn,
    hanzo-metal-kernels) rather than upstream candle-core / candle-nn.
  - OpenAI-compatible `/v1` server plus an Anthropic-compatible
    `POST /v1/messages` endpoint (streaming + tool use), served from one router.
  - All-modality serving: text/chat, vision (hanzo-vision), audio in and 24 kHz
    speech out (hanzo-audio), video and image/diffusion models, long-form film
    orchestration (hanzo-film), and 3D (hanzo-3d).
  - GPU backend coverage across CUDA, Apple Metal, and AMD ROCm/HIP
    (Dockerfile.cuda, Dockerfile.rocm, and the Metal kernels).
  - Broad quantization support: GGUF, ISQ, UQFF, Q8_0/Q4_K, IQ4, MXFP4, HQQ,
    AFQ, and bitsandbytes FP4.
  - Zen model serving (native/zen3-serving and the zen model paths).
  - Adapter primitives: AnyMoE plus LoRA and QLoRA adapters.
  - Hanzo ZAP transport integration (hanzo-engine/src/zap) and a disk-first KV
    cache for cross-restart sessions and agent prefix reuse.
  - Sandboxed local code execution (hanzo-sandbox, hanzo-code-exec) for the
    agentic runtime.
